    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "附录A(资料性附录）齿轮图样格式示例",
        "text_level": 1,
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "本附录仅列举出渐开线圆柱齿轮(图A.1)、锥齿轮(图A.2)蜗杆(图A.3)和蜗轮(图A.4)的图样格式。",
        "page_idx": 8,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "图中的参数表一般放在图样的右上角。",
        "page_idx": 8,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "参数表中列出的参数项目可根据需要增减，检验项目按功能要求而定。",
        "text_level": 0,
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "图样中的技术要求一般放在该图样的右下角。",
        "page_idx": 8,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "/home/crrc/PycharmProjects/FlaskOllama/data/parse_files_data/1954006319560286208/0ec3d06e4afe973abfb4e2c8683ad611113a630ebbf47c9b3ae8b8fb8f095e1d.jpg",
        "img_caption": [],
        "img_footnote": [],
